            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2021-eight-provinces-jan:grammar-fill:3",
            "text": "While many of your trusted relatives and peers (同龄人) may have very valuable advice that can help you to make the decision, finally the choice is yours and yours alone. Only you can fully realize which aspects of a college will make you truly happy and satisfied, so keep that at the front of your mind."
          },
